cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this independent synthetic benchmark when using its code or data."
type: software
title: "Synthetic certified hydropower repair benchmark"
authors:
  - family-names: "Rodriguez Castro"
    given-names: "Mathias"
    affiliation: "Facultad de Ingenieria, Universidad de la Republica, Uruguay"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Independent synthetic examples for certified affine hydropower repair and
  repeated linear coordination. Includes generated scenarios, full initial
  MILP witnesses, three certified bounds, raw LP results, exact-rational
  checks and 192-LP open-source replay. It uses the same polynomial family
  with independent coefficients; it does not reproduce the restricted
  10000-case Rio Negro study or benchmark other production-function families.
keywords:
  - hydropower scheduling
  - certified affine bounds
  - linear programming
  - reproducible research
